@startuml 04-partial-delivery-continuation
title Domain Story 4 — Partial Delivery Creates Continuation
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "Dispatch Coordinator" as Dispatch
actor "Delivery Actor" as Driver
actor "B2B Buyer" as Buyer
participant Delivery

Dispatch -> Delivery : Schedule Delivery within time window
Driver -> Delivery : Record actual attempt and delivered quantity
alt failed attempt
  Delivery -> Delivery : Preserve attempt on same Delivery
  Delivery -> Delivery : Operations decides another attempt / reschedule
else partial outcome
  Delivery -> Delivery : Preserve delivered and remaining quantities
  Delivery -> Delivery : Create one idempotent child Continuation Delivery
  Delivery --> Buyer : Expose delivered result and remaining obligation
else complete
  Delivery --> Buyer : Expose delivered result
end

note over Delivery
Continuation is neither another attempt of the original Delivery
nor a new backorder. Returned/rejected goods go to Warehouse HOLD pending inspection.
end note
@enduml
